Testing while loops (intay):
  Simple while loop:
    Counter: 1
    Counter: 2
    Counter: 3
    Counter: 4
    Counter: 5
  While loop with break (jooji):
    Counter: 1
    Counter: 2
    Counter: 3
    Counter: 4
    Counter: 5
    Breaking the loop at counter = 5
  While loop with continue (soco):
    Odd counter: 1
    Odd counter: 3
    Odd counter: 5
  Nested while loops:
    Outer loop: 1
      Inner loop: 1
      Inner loop: 2
    Outer loop: 2
      Inner loop: 1
      Inner loop: 2
    Outer loop: 3
      Inner loop: 1
      Inner loop: 2
  While loop with decimal values:
    x = 0.5
    x = 1
    x = 1.5
    x = 2
    x = 2.5
  Factorial calculation for 5:
    5! = 120
